WEBVTT

01:33.350 --> 01:35.320
(Adapted from the web novel "Waiting for You in a City")

01:35.391 --> 01:37.820
(Fireworks of My Heart)

01:37.891 --> 01:40.761
(Episode 38)

01:41.960 --> 01:42.791
Zhai Miao.

01:44.561 --> 01:45.901
No matter how unwilling we are,

01:47.531 --> 01:48.830
we can't turn back time.

01:50.201 --> 01:51.841
Yes, we can't turn back time.

01:52.100 --> 01:53.171
But the wound is still there.

01:54.811 --> 01:55.611
Song Yan.

01:56.041 --> 01:58.481
How could you forgive them so easily?

02:01.281 --> 02:02.180
You're wrong.

02:03.680 --> 02:04.720
I haven't forgiven them.

02:06.281 --> 02:07.720
In fact, I don't want them to apologize.

02:09.091 --> 02:10.291
Even if they apologize,

02:11.291 --> 02:12.421
I won't forgive them.

02:13.861 --> 02:15.091
But I have no resentment.

02:16.460 --> 02:18.101
Nor do I have the heart to take revenge.

02:19.601 --> 02:21.601
Because I don't want to live the rest of my life...

02:23.201 --> 02:25.201
with resentment in my heart.

02:36.810 --> 02:37.611
I'm not telling you...

02:37.981 --> 02:39.221
to save anyone.

02:40.620 --> 02:42.451
But do what should be done.

02:44.250 --> 02:45.261
No thanks necessary,

02:46.161 --> 02:47.520
no apologies necessary.

02:51.661 --> 02:52.460
As for me,

02:53.631 --> 02:54.900
I'm doing well now.

02:55.731 --> 02:56.800
I'll do even better in the future.

02:59.370 --> 03:00.441
Let bygones be bygones.

03:02.041 --> 03:03.071
Just let it go.

03:04.671 --> 03:05.641
There's no need to hold grudges.

03:09.210 --> 03:10.310
If you say so.

03:11.210 --> 03:13.550
I'm not the one who wasted 10 years of my life anyway.

03:15.721 --> 03:16.921
I'll hand over the evidence.

03:18.020 --> 03:19.620
But whatever I do before that...

03:20.721 --> 03:21.731
is none of your business.

03:27.361 --> 03:28.601
No matter what you do,

03:29.370 --> 03:30.300
remember this.

03:31.231 --> 03:33.101
We don't harm anyone.

03:35.041 --> 03:36.270
I don't need you to lecture me.

03:38.981 --> 03:39.710
Zhai Miao.

04:09.941 --> 04:10.740
Uncle.

04:10.911 --> 04:11.680
Aunt.

04:13.180 --> 04:14.851
- How did it go? - We found the witness.

04:14.911 --> 04:16.310
She has video evidence...

04:16.381 --> 04:18.050
that can prove Yan Chen's innocence.

04:18.321 --> 04:19.421
How much money does she want?

04:19.721 --> 04:21.490
Give her as much as she wants...

04:21.891 --> 04:23.221
as long as she gives us the evidence.

04:23.351 --> 04:24.421
The problem is...

04:24.550 --> 04:25.560
she doesn't want money.

04:49.611 --> 04:50.711
Important guests are here.

04:51.111 --> 04:52.221
My house is small.

04:52.450 --> 04:53.250
Please don't mind it.

05:01.930 --> 05:02.661
Hello.

05:04.331 --> 05:05.901
We're here to pay you a visit.

05:06.700 --> 05:08.101
Is there anyone else at home?

05:08.971 --> 05:10.200
It's just me.

05:10.300 --> 05:11.101
Just get to the point.

05:12.240 --> 05:13.200
What do you want?

05:13.541 --> 05:14.341
Just name it.

05:20.041 --> 05:21.680
How should I address you?

05:22.411 --> 05:23.250
Zhai Miao.

05:24.151 --> 05:24.921
Okay.

05:25.581 --> 05:26.450
Ms. Zhai.

05:27.250 --> 05:28.221
We're here today...

05:28.421 --> 05:29.351
for only one reason.

05:30.050 --> 05:31.690
We just want to talk to you.

05:32.291 --> 05:33.091
I hope...

05:33.620 --> 05:35.690
you can help us resolve this matter.

05:38.260 --> 05:39.760
You both are so nice.

05:40.200 --> 05:41.500
I thought you would yell at me first.

05:41.901 --> 05:43.731
Time is of the essence, so let's cut to the chase.

05:43.901 --> 05:44.630
Why don't we...

05:44.971 --> 05:46.440
get straight to the point?

05:51.041 --> 05:52.081
What happened back then...

05:52.611 --> 05:53.981
was indeed our fault.

05:54.411 --> 05:55.510
We were wrong.

05:56.680 --> 05:58.521
If there's any way we can make up for it,

05:59.050 --> 06:00.180
just let us know.

06:06.620 --> 06:07.661
If you want revenge,

06:07.721 --> 06:08.890
come at me.

06:09.190 --> 06:10.490
Meng Yan Chen is innocent.

06:10.560 --> 06:11.630
You've never met him.

06:11.700 --> 06:13.260
He's a good kid.

06:13.601 --> 06:14.901
But your classmates...

06:14.971 --> 06:16.370
twisted the truth and accused him,

06:16.531 --> 06:17.971
calling him a rapist.

06:19.401 --> 06:20.440
As family,

06:20.771 --> 06:21.870
I'm sure...

06:22.211 --> 06:23.671
you can understand how we feel.

06:23.740 --> 06:25.611
- You... - How could I not know how you feel?

06:26.781 --> 06:27.581
Mrs. Fu.

06:28.310 --> 06:29.711
When you framed my brother,

06:30.380 --> 06:32.820
did you think about how his family felt?

06:32.880 --> 06:34.721
What you felt for a few hours...

06:35.351 --> 06:37.320
is what my family experienced for many years.

06:38.661 --> 06:39.961
You stabbed me 10 times.

06:40.361 --> 06:41.560
I slapped you just once.

06:42.161 --> 06:43.291
Is this even revenge?

06:45.361 --> 06:47.000
My parents and brother...

06:47.401 --> 06:48.401
are kind-hearted people.

06:48.731 --> 06:50.901
They didn't tell Yan Chen and Xu Qin...

06:50.971 --> 06:52.401
your true colors.

06:53.601 --> 06:54.870
Just because they don't pursue the matter,

06:56.070 --> 06:57.570
doesn't mean I won't.

07:07.421 --> 07:08.950
Whatever you choose,

07:09.750 --> 07:10.820
I'll go along with you.

07:11.091 --> 07:12.560
Back then, my dad kneeled down to you.

07:13.661 --> 07:14.461
Mrs. Fu.

07:15.260 --> 07:16.661
If you really want to apologize,

07:17.731 --> 07:19.361
you can return the kneeling.

07:30.570 --> 07:31.680
I am young.

07:31.981 --> 07:33.081
I'm afraid my life will be shortened.

07:33.211 --> 07:34.640
But if it's on behalf of my brother...

07:35.111 --> 07:36.250
and my family,

07:37.380 --> 07:38.921
I can accept 10 of them.

07:54.901 --> 07:55.630
No.

07:56.870 --> 07:57.671
No.

08:02.740 --> 08:03.570
I'll do it.

08:03.841 --> 08:04.541
Huai Jin!

08:04.611 --> 08:06.411
I'll do it! It's not a big deal!

08:06.481 --> 08:08.041
Huai Jin!

08:15.421 --> 08:16.221
I'll do it.

08:17.620 --> 08:18.421
Let me.

09:00.061 --> 09:00.831
That's enough.

09:10.446 --> 09:11.615
Xu Qin is my sister-in-law.

09:12.211 --> 09:13.341
You're her parents.

09:15.211 --> 09:17.081
If I had accepted that kneeling,

09:17.510 --> 09:19.120
I wouldn't be able to face her.

09:21.451 --> 09:22.250
Mrs. Fu.

09:23.091 --> 09:24.490
You should take responsibility...

09:24.951 --> 09:26.890
for what you've done wrong.

09:27.721 --> 09:28.861
If you bear the responsibility,

09:29.331 --> 09:31.191
naturally, your child won't have to.

10:05.301 --> 10:06.361
I'll go in with you.

10:23.880 --> 10:24.581
Hello.

10:24.910 --> 10:26.181
How can I help you?

10:28.250 --> 10:29.250
I'm here to turn myself in.

10:50.611 --> 10:51.341
Mrs. Fu.

10:51.611 --> 10:52.540
Calm down.

10:52.611 --> 10:54.140
Why don't you just die?

10:54.611 --> 10:56.611
- Be careful. - Why don't you just die?

11:03.351 --> 11:04.890
Do you want me to die?

11:06.091 --> 11:07.561
I thought you were a sensible...

11:08.321 --> 11:09.660
and obedient child.

11:10.461 --> 11:11.260
I didn't expect...

11:12.260 --> 11:14.601
that you would do such a horrible thing...

11:14.660 --> 11:15.801
to force me.

11:16.101 --> 11:18.030
You're really something.

11:21.201 --> 11:22.341
I'm sorry, Mom.

11:27.581 --> 11:29.081
But you did something wrong.

11:30.851 --> 11:32.451
Someone has to take responsibility.

11:33.951 --> 11:35.221
I'm your son.

11:37.650 --> 11:38.961
If you won't take responsibility,

11:40.561 --> 11:41.660
I will.

11:42.861 --> 11:43.790
Fine.

11:44.061 --> 11:45.461
My good son.

11:46.660 --> 11:48.530
You're forcing me to die.

11:50.701 --> 11:52.000
I'm not forcing you.

11:54.400 --> 11:56.211
I'm in so much pain right now.

11:58.370 --> 12:00.181
I don't know what to do.

12:16.561 --> 12:17.561
Each and everyone of you...

12:20.201 --> 12:21.900
thinks that I'm evil.

12:24.030 --> 12:25.640
You want to cut ties with me...

12:29.140 --> 12:30.441
and cut ties...

12:31.811 --> 12:32.581
with this family.

12:38.250 --> 12:39.020
Fine.

12:42.490 --> 12:43.321
As you wish.

12:45.890 --> 12:47.061
You're free now.

14:12.841 --> 14:13.740
Come on, everyone.

14:13.811 --> 14:14.811
Come here.

14:15.451 --> 14:16.451
Gather round.

14:17.650 --> 14:19.520
I'll update you on the situation.

14:20.321 --> 14:21.250
Currently,

14:21.481 --> 14:22.620
we have solid evidence.

14:23.091 --> 14:25.191
It was recorded clearly in the video from the witness.

14:25.250 --> 14:26.390
Nothing happened.

14:27.221 --> 14:29.091
It was all planned by Ye Zi alone.

14:29.390 --> 14:30.990
- What? - How is that possible?

14:31.061 --> 14:32.130
You said it before.

14:32.201 --> 14:33.331
If you accused the innocent,

14:33.400 --> 14:34.831
you'd publish an apology in the newspaper.

14:35.231 --> 14:36.130
Our kindness was taken advantage of.

14:36.201 --> 14:37.370
This is horrible!

14:37.831 --> 14:39.770
- How could Ye Zi do this? - That's right.

14:39.841 --> 14:41.601
You must feel guilty.

14:42.000 --> 14:43.170
You incited cyberbullying...

14:43.240 --> 14:44.841
from a one-sided story.

14:45.040 --> 14:46.441
Be careful in the future.

14:48.611 --> 14:49.981
All right. It's fine now.

14:50.051 --> 14:51.010
Go back to school.

14:51.581 --> 14:52.451
Go now.

14:52.581 --> 14:53.451
- Go to class. - Thank you, sir.

14:53.581 --> 14:55.351
- Thank you, sir. - Go on.

14:56.890 --> 14:59.290
That's right. Ye Zi is too much.

14:59.361 --> 15:00.790
We stood here all day for nothing.

15:09.170 --> 15:09.971
Yan Chen.

15:10.101 --> 15:11.000
Are you hungry?

15:11.101 --> 15:12.941
Do you want to have skewers at Ms. Hong's?

15:13.601 --> 15:14.400
Sure.

15:14.801 --> 15:16.341
Or if you're tired,

15:16.640 --> 15:17.571
we can order takeout.

15:18.471 --> 15:19.280
Anything is fine.

15:25.821 --> 15:26.581
Qin Qin.

15:32.420 --> 15:33.861
I have something to take care of.

15:34.691 --> 15:35.990
You go ahead.

15:37.331 --> 15:38.091
Yan Chen.

15:38.790 --> 15:41.101
Everyone should take responsibility for their own actions.

15:43.400 --> 15:44.201
I know.

15:44.831 --> 15:45.701
I'm fine now.

15:46.500 --> 15:47.370
Don't worry.

15:56.910 --> 15:57.750
Excuse me.

15:58.211 --> 15:59.280
I want to see Ye Zi.

15:59.451 --> 16:00.520
She's under criminal custody.

16:00.581 --> 16:01.721
Only lawyers can see her.

16:03.551 --> 16:04.451
What if...

16:05.420 --> 16:07.290
I drop the criminal charges against her...

16:07.961 --> 16:09.030
and apply for a settlement?

16:09.561 --> 16:11.660
Then can I request a visitation...

16:11.861 --> 16:12.900
as a friend?

16:13.461 --> 16:16.431
(Fuming Police Station)

16:27.841 --> 16:28.951
How's your brother?

16:29.611 --> 16:31.451
He's fine.

16:40.591 --> 16:41.620
Let me see.

16:42.790 --> 16:43.660
What's wrong?

16:43.861 --> 16:44.961
Why do you keep crying?

16:54.471 --> 16:55.240
Crybaby.

16:58.841 --> 16:59.740
All right.

17:00.211 --> 17:01.111
Let's go.

17:06.420 --> 17:08.351
(Fuming Police Station, Yancheng)

17:22.430 --> 17:23.630
Why are you here?

17:26.370 --> 17:29.071
To show your compassion for a girl who has lost her footing?

17:32.111 --> 17:33.281
If you wanted money,

17:34.710 --> 17:35.851
you could've just asked me.

17:36.410 --> 17:37.650
You didn't have to do this.

17:39.920 --> 17:40.880
So you think...

17:44.051 --> 17:45.220
I should be grateful to you...

17:45.291 --> 17:47.160
for throwing some scrap paper at me?

17:50.160 --> 17:51.130
You know it.

17:52.660 --> 17:53.900
That's not what I meant.

17:56.801 --> 17:57.970
Then what do you mean?

18:00.771 --> 18:03.341
Isn't someone like me only qualified to talk about money with you?

18:05.410 --> 18:06.440
I'm poor.

18:07.980 --> 18:10.650
That's why it's a sin to even have feelings for someone.

18:20.761 --> 18:22.390
You obviously don't like me.

18:23.430 --> 18:25.361
Then why did you provoke me?

18:26.361 --> 18:28.561
You don't think working at a bar is suitable for me.

18:29.700 --> 18:31.601
You're the one who introduced me to a job.

18:32.230 --> 18:34.470
You're the one who asked me to go to a concert with you.

18:34.970 --> 18:37.541
You're also the one who's worried I'd go astray with plastic surgery!

18:37.841 --> 18:39.480
It's all you, isn't it?

18:40.081 --> 18:40.940
Mr. Meng.

18:41.611 --> 18:43.081
I just don't want you to go astray.

18:47.420 --> 18:48.880
You don't want me to go astray?

18:52.690 --> 18:54.561
Do I need your charity?

18:54.991 --> 18:56.960
Are you my savior?

18:58.761 --> 18:59.900
I just want...

19:01.400 --> 19:03.031
your life to be better.

19:12.041 --> 19:12.841
What?

19:15.281 --> 19:17.180
You can't bear to see me suffer?

19:18.781 --> 19:20.180
Initially,

19:20.251 --> 19:21.720
my world was completely dark.

19:22.950 --> 19:24.690
Suddenly, a ray of light came in.

19:24.751 --> 19:27.291
My heart suddenly lit up.

19:28.261 --> 19:28.960
Is it...

19:29.031 --> 19:31.361
Is it wrong for me to want to get closer to it?

19:32.091 --> 19:34.331
What exactly am I to you?

19:34.801 --> 19:36.970
A program that can be deleted at any time?

19:37.970 --> 19:39.771
A disgusting moth?

19:49.511 --> 19:50.710
I won't hold charges against you.

19:58.150 --> 19:59.051
Do you think...

19:59.120 --> 20:00.960
you're good by repaying evil with kindness?

20:02.321 --> 20:04.190
Sometimes, I wish you were...

20:04.261 --> 20:05.930
a despicable person, a scumbag instead!

20:06.001 --> 20:07.730
It's better than what you are now.

20:08.361 --> 20:09.271
Meng Yan Chen!

20:09.331 --> 20:10.531
Who do you think you are?

20:11.601 --> 20:12.571
Meng Yan Chen!

20:14.170 --> 20:15.271
Who do you think you are?

20:39.430 --> 20:43.531
(Vice President's Office)

20:43.771 --> 20:44.930
(Medical Responsibility)

21:07.720 --> 21:08.890
I'll let you in on a little gossip.

21:09.960 --> 21:10.861
I heard...

21:10.930 --> 21:12.390
that Mr. Liu...

21:12.460 --> 21:14.061
was arrested for some serious crime...

21:14.130 --> 21:15.130
and was taken away.

21:15.730 --> 21:16.700
Really?

21:16.771 --> 21:17.900
For what crime?

21:17.970 --> 21:19.071
I'm not sure.

21:19.130 --> 21:20.900
Anyway, I never really liked him.

21:28.880 --> 21:29.611
Officer Huang.

21:30.011 --> 21:30.851
Mr. Guo.

21:31.511 --> 21:33.521
After our higher law department and bureau chiefs...

21:33.581 --> 21:34.650
have reviewed the case,

21:34.720 --> 21:35.650
we believe that since Fu Wen Ying...

21:35.720 --> 21:36.851
has turned herself in...

21:37.551 --> 21:39.021
and is suffering from a serious illness,

21:39.150 --> 21:40.720
she won't be a threat to society.

21:40.960 --> 21:41.761
Therefore, it has been decided...

21:41.861 --> 21:43.361
that she will be released on bail, pending trial.

21:43.730 --> 21:44.890
She has been informed...

21:44.960 --> 21:45.930
and has signed the paperwork.

21:47.761 --> 21:49.200
So during the period of bail,

21:49.400 --> 21:51.331
she's not to leave the place of execution without authorization.

21:51.400 --> 21:53.241
If there's anything, let me know.

21:53.370 --> 21:54.541
Surely. Thank you.

21:55.170 --> 21:55.940
Thank you.

22:16.291 --> 22:17.660
(Bed 28)

22:43.220 --> 22:44.150
Thank you, doctor.

22:44.351 --> 22:45.960
- Call me if you need anything. - Okay.

23:46.851 --> 23:48.120
Song Yan's sister...

23:49.620 --> 23:50.890
is quite capable.

23:51.821 --> 23:52.620
That's enough.

23:53.960 --> 23:55.091
Stop thinking too much.

23:55.521 --> 23:56.960
Don't think...

23:57.861 --> 23:59.501
because she helped Yan Chen,

24:01.331 --> 24:02.730
I'll accept Song Yan.

24:04.531 --> 24:05.571
It's impossible.

24:06.101 --> 24:07.801
But in my opinion,

24:08.771 --> 24:09.741
our Qin Qin...

24:10.470 --> 24:11.940
will never part from him.

24:15.081 --> 24:16.081
Huai Jin.

24:20.321 --> 24:21.321
So many things...

24:22.720 --> 24:24.521
have happened between our families.

24:25.551 --> 24:26.561
Do you think...

24:27.291 --> 24:29.321
we can be a family?

24:36.001 --> 24:37.531
Do you really think...

24:39.130 --> 24:41.140
I don't know what you've done all these years?

24:41.841 --> 24:42.841
No.

24:43.071 --> 24:44.071
I didn't interfere,

24:44.241 --> 24:45.811
ask questions or make decisions.

24:46.781 --> 24:47.480
I even...

24:48.180 --> 24:49.180
pretended not to know.

24:50.380 --> 24:51.581
That's because...

24:53.281 --> 24:54.281
some of the things...

24:54.581 --> 24:56.051
benefited me.

24:59.761 --> 25:01.091
You played the bad person,

25:02.160 --> 25:03.660
while I got all the credit.

25:04.361 --> 25:05.390
That was wrong of me.

25:06.160 --> 25:07.601
It's not entirely your fault.

25:09.001 --> 25:09.730
So...

25:10.801 --> 25:12.170
don't get caught up in the grievance...

25:13.400 --> 25:15.370
all by yourself.

25:17.140 --> 25:18.041
Okay?

25:40.460 --> 25:41.501
You heard...

25:41.801 --> 25:43.400
everything I said that night?

25:48.200 --> 25:49.571
You won't come home again, right?

25:54.940 --> 25:56.380
Even though Mom and Dad were wrong,

25:57.111 --> 25:59.980
you didn't have to hurt them in such a way.

26:02.180 --> 26:03.491
Have you thought about it?

26:04.021 --> 26:06.220
If there wasn't a witness who had the evidence,

26:06.291 --> 26:07.761
your life would've been ruined.

26:08.521 --> 26:09.930
Why are you doing this?

26:14.361 --> 26:15.501
At that time,

26:17.700 --> 26:19.230
I just didn't want to do anything.

26:20.940 --> 26:23.271
Maybe Mom and Dad did something that disappointed you.

26:24.440 --> 26:26.281
But no one is perfect.

26:26.741 --> 26:28.480
To want them to live a perfect life without mistakes...

26:29.111 --> 26:30.210
is harsh too.

26:36.021 --> 26:36.890
Can you...

26:38.251 --> 26:39.890
convince yourself with these words?

26:42.991 --> 26:43.730
Qin Qin.

26:45.761 --> 26:47.130
Don't you hate our family?

26:49.501 --> 26:50.730
I don't have the right to hate.

26:51.370 --> 26:52.730
I just feel sorry for Song Yan.

26:54.541 --> 26:56.071
Now I finally understand...

26:58.741 --> 27:00.011
why after all this time,

27:01.811 --> 27:03.710
you still choose to be with him.

27:06.111 --> 27:07.321
Because he's determined enough...

27:09.351 --> 27:10.751
to never let you go.

27:11.620 --> 27:13.521
Even after so many hardships,

27:14.491 --> 27:15.561
you and him...

27:17.390 --> 27:18.591
will only be together in the end.

27:24.970 --> 27:25.771
Yan Chen.

27:27.741 --> 27:29.101
Live for yourself.

27:30.571 --> 27:31.410
Okay?

27:56.700 --> 27:58.101
That teacher's lecture today...

27:58.170 --> 27:59.331
was really interesting.

28:04.210 --> 28:05.210
She still has the nerves to come back.

28:06.071 --> 28:07.210
Stop it.

28:07.940 --> 28:09.180
Why can't I speak?

28:09.851 --> 28:12.051
We stood up for her just so she wouldn't be wronged.

28:13.220 --> 28:14.380
We took her as a friend,

28:14.680 --> 28:16.150
but she used us as tools.

28:26.501 --> 28:27.230
All right.

28:27.301 --> 28:28.700
Let's go eat.

28:28.761 --> 28:30.331
Miao Miao, let's go.

28:31.370 --> 28:32.501
You guys go ahead.

28:32.700 --> 28:34.101
You're the one who has it the worst!

28:34.170 --> 28:36.001
What was the use of doing so much for the account?

28:36.071 --> 28:37.071
I'm sorry.

28:37.670 --> 28:39.440
In the end, you were tricked by your lousy partner.

28:39.640 --> 28:42.210
(Molecular Biology)

29:07.140 --> 29:08.271
I'm sorry, Zhai Miao.

29:13.940 --> 29:15.841
I promised to review the account with you.

29:17.180 --> 29:19.281
Now you don't even have an account because of me.

29:24.851 --> 29:26.150
What do you plan to do in the future?

29:26.861 --> 29:29.390
I don't even know if I have a future now.

29:31.930 --> 29:33.331
Don't look down on yourself.

29:44.470 --> 29:46.480
Do you blame me?

29:53.581 --> 29:55.821
I'm actually glad you stepped up.

29:58.650 --> 29:59.450
Otherwise...

30:03.491 --> 30:04.861
I might have lost the chance...

30:05.460 --> 30:06.960
to turn back.

30:13.041 --> 30:14.640
I really take you as a friend.

30:21.440 --> 30:22.440
Goodbye.

31:05.351 --> 31:06.251
Qin Qin.

31:08.821 --> 31:09.660
Dad.

31:11.061 --> 31:12.230
In a few days,

31:12.291 --> 31:13.761
your mom can come home to recuperate.

31:17.370 --> 31:18.331
I wonder...

31:19.430 --> 31:21.370
if you can take some time to see her.

31:28.940 --> 31:29.851
Qin Qin.

31:31.480 --> 31:32.611
You might not believe...

31:32.851 --> 31:33.821
what I say.

31:34.581 --> 31:35.620
But...

31:36.690 --> 31:38.220
if it were you who was in trouble,

31:40.361 --> 31:42.061
your mom would also do everything for you.

31:46.160 --> 31:46.930
I admit.

31:48.101 --> 31:49.501
We're not good parents.

31:51.301 --> 31:52.831
Instead of our children's feelings,

31:53.900 --> 31:54.970
what we prioritized...

31:56.170 --> 31:57.210
was interest.

31:59.841 --> 32:01.640
But I still want to tell you this.

32:02.880 --> 32:05.180
Whether it's me or your mom,

32:05.480 --> 32:07.480
we treat you and Yan Chen...

32:08.480 --> 32:09.521
all the same.

32:13.460 --> 32:14.521
If Yan Chen suffers,

32:15.660 --> 32:16.761
Mom will be heartbroken.

32:18.660 --> 32:19.791
But when I suffer,

32:20.730 --> 32:22.101
does it break her heart too?

32:23.331 --> 32:24.531
If it does,

32:25.301 --> 32:27.041
is it the same pain she has for my brother?

32:29.541 --> 32:30.670
Mom asked me...

32:31.440 --> 32:33.440
how I could hurt my parents because of a man.

32:34.281 --> 32:36.581
But when she was ruining the person I love the most,

32:38.650 --> 32:40.620
did she not think that she was hurting me?

32:41.081 --> 32:42.251
If she did think...

32:42.581 --> 32:43.551
that it would hurt me,

32:45.690 --> 32:47.160
does it break her heart too?

33:04.440 --> 33:05.341
But Dad,

33:06.680 --> 33:07.781
for what happened to Song Yan,

33:08.980 --> 33:09.880
I can't forgive her.

33:12.781 --> 33:13.581
But Qin Qin,

33:14.680 --> 33:15.751
we're a family.

33:16.890 --> 33:18.251
A family...

33:18.321 --> 33:19.720
is bound together for life.

33:19.890 --> 33:20.960
Throughout life,

33:21.021 --> 33:23.061
there will be ups and downs.

33:23.491 --> 33:24.361
How can you...

33:24.690 --> 33:26.761
cut ties so easily?

33:28.101 --> 33:29.361
There's a problem now.

33:29.761 --> 33:31.670
We can discuss and resolve it.

33:31.730 --> 33:33.341
How can we resolve it?

33:34.700 --> 33:37.370
Do we give him a degree or a future?

33:39.140 --> 33:39.940
Dad.

33:40.081 --> 33:41.480
Have you thought about it?

33:42.180 --> 33:43.281
Given Song Yan's personality,

33:43.351 --> 33:44.680
he can't stand the slightest humiliation.

33:45.081 --> 33:46.980
Even if the king of heaven bullies him,

33:47.051 --> 33:48.220
he will fight back.

33:48.950 --> 33:50.220
But he has never thought...

33:50.291 --> 33:51.821
of exposing the matter to the public.

33:54.361 --> 33:55.690
The Meng family has many rivals.

33:56.491 --> 33:58.531
But he never said a word.

34:00.331 --> 34:02.031
He let you off the hook.

34:03.700 --> 34:05.170
What else do you want from him?

34:05.601 --> 34:06.571
Is it for my sake...

34:06.841 --> 34:08.301
because you're my parents?

34:08.900 --> 34:10.271
Or is it...

34:11.271 --> 34:12.970
so we could eat together?

34:17.281 --> 34:18.380
Some conflicts...

34:21.080 --> 34:23.721
can't be resolved by a meal or two.

34:24.891 --> 34:26.451
Dad, I'm really tired.

34:26.520 --> 34:27.991
I don't want to face these things anymore.

34:28.060 --> 34:29.520
I don't want to cry anymore.

34:31.931 --> 34:32.861
All right.

34:33.330 --> 34:34.361
Let's not talk about it.

34:34.500 --> 34:36.630
Let's not talk about the past.

34:37.431 --> 34:38.500
The days are long.

34:38.600 --> 34:39.431
We'll take it slow.

34:40.040 --> 34:41.770
But I'll say this again.

34:42.900 --> 34:43.940
There are no obstacles...

34:44.540 --> 34:45.641
a family can't overcome.

34:54.321 --> 34:55.250
Thank you for coming.

34:57.621 --> 34:59.721
I'll take you to the hospital. It's on the way.

35:00.690 --> 35:01.891
It's nearby.

35:01.960 --> 35:03.161
There's traffic at the hospital.

35:05.790 --> 35:07.060
When you have decided on the wedding date,

35:07.330 --> 35:08.630
you must tell me.

35:11.571 --> 35:12.330
Qin Qin.

35:56.040 --> 35:57.080
Excuse me.

35:57.650 --> 35:59.650
She was discharged this afternoon.

36:01.080 --> 36:01.880
I see.

37:22.801 --> 37:23.730
Yan Er.

37:24.100 --> 37:25.571
Keep an eye out for your uncle.

37:25.630 --> 37:27.306
He can't see well because of his old age.

37:27.801 --> 37:28.571
Okay.

37:29.571 --> 37:31.670
Actually, a person is like a house.

37:31.741 --> 37:32.611
After a while,

37:32.670 --> 37:34.741
it becomes old, worn out, and has a lot of problems.

37:34.810 --> 37:36.439
It becomes easily despised.

37:37.055 --> 37:38.955
Why are you offended?

37:38.980 --> 37:41.020
Which one of your eyes saw me despise you?

37:41.781 --> 37:42.980
There are four leaks.

37:43.051 --> 37:44.591
Look carefully and fill them all up.

37:44.650 --> 37:46.451
Otherwise, our house will have an ocean view.

37:47.661 --> 37:48.621
The view at our house...

37:48.690 --> 37:50.060
is just as good as an ocean view.

37:50.130 --> 37:50.960
Right, Xu Qin?

37:51.330 --> 37:52.130
Yes.

37:53.290 --> 37:54.531
What a pity. It's going to be demolished.

37:55.000 --> 37:55.801
We've lived here for decades.

37:55.861 --> 37:57.170
I really can't bear to move out.

38:02.841 --> 38:03.770
Why did you come up?

38:03.841 --> 38:04.810
I came to help.

38:06.170 --> 38:06.940
Take a break.

38:28.031 --> 38:28.861
Yan Er.

38:29.161 --> 38:30.400
Your house.

38:30.571 --> 38:31.431
How's the preparation going?

38:31.630 --> 38:32.471
Uncle.

38:35.371 --> 38:36.100
It's almost done.

38:36.170 --> 38:37.440
Just a little bit more.

38:38.170 --> 38:39.341
- That's good. - Dear.

38:39.971 --> 38:41.540
Come and give me a hand.

38:41.611 --> 38:42.511
Coming.

38:45.580 --> 38:47.020
I'll do the laundry.

38:47.621 --> 38:49.380
Just rest. I'll do it.

39:00.500 --> 39:01.301
Li Meng.

39:03.571 --> 39:04.400
This is for you.

39:06.301 --> 39:08.741
What is it?

39:08.801 --> 39:10.141
Water it once every seven days.

39:34.734 --> 39:36.761
- Slow down. - Hold on tight, Dr. Xu.

39:41.170 --> 39:42.100
Am I heavy?

39:46.770 --> 39:47.580
Put me down.

39:54.181 --> 39:55.020
Dad.

39:55.621 --> 39:56.951
Why are you here?

40:03.520 --> 40:04.261
I...

40:09.261 --> 40:10.130
Mom.

40:10.155 --> 40:11.925
Why aren't Song Yan and Xu Qin back yet?

40:12.276 --> 40:13.176
Don't worry.

40:13.201 --> 40:14.301
Your brother has informed her.

40:14.326 --> 40:15.696
They'll be back for dinner.

40:20.170 --> 40:21.841
- They're back. - Song Yan, Xu Qin.

40:23.898 --> 40:25.555
Uncle, Aunt, Zhai Miao.

40:25.580 --> 40:26.781
This is my dad.

40:40.400 --> 40:41.100
Hello.

40:41.661 --> 40:44.000
I came uninvited.

40:44.431 --> 40:45.371
Sorry to bother you.

40:47.971 --> 40:49.100
Don't say that.

40:49.170 --> 40:50.241
You're too formal.

40:51.040 --> 40:52.141
Thank you.

40:52.210 --> 40:53.911
Mr. Meng, please have a seat.

40:53.980 --> 40:55.940
Yes. We have some food.

40:56.011 --> 40:57.250
If you don't mind,

40:57.310 --> 40:58.580
why don't you join us for dinner?

40:59.411 --> 41:00.310
All right.

41:01.121 --> 41:02.380
I won't stand on ceremony.
